re {\n      font-size: 22px;\n      color: var(--srl-compare);\n      text-decoration: line-through;\n    }\n\n    .srl-hero__save {\n      background: var(--srl-save-bg);\n      color: #fff;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      padding: 6px 12px;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .srl-hero__desc {\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n      margin: 0 0 24px;\n    }\n\n    .srl-hero__list-title {\n      font-size: 17px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      margin: 0 0 14px;\n    }\n\n    .srl-hero__list {\n      list-style: none;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .srl-hero__item {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .srl-hero__check {\n      flex: none;\n      width: 22px;\n      height: 22px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: var(--srl-check-bg);\n      color: #fff;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      margin-top: 2px;\n    }\n\n    .srl-hero__item-text {\n      min-width: 0;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n\n    .srl-hero__item-text b {\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    @media screen and (max-width: 480px) {\n      .srl-hero__rating {\n        gap: 12px;\n        padding: 14px;\n      }\n\n      .srl-hero__stars {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        letter-spacing: 1px;\n      }\n\n      .srl-hero__rating-text {\n        font-size: 13px;\n      }\n\n      .srl-hero__title {\n        font-size: 34px;\n      }\n\n      .srl-hero__subtitle {\n        font-size: 18px;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n\n  <div class=\"srl-hero__rating\">\n    {% if srl_show_reviews %}\n      <span class=\"srl-hero__stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      <p class=\"srl-hero__rating-text\">\n        {{ srl_rating }} basado en +{{ srl_num_reviews }} opiniones verificadas en Amazon y TikTok\n      </p>\n    {% else %}\n      <span class=\"srl-hero__badge-icon\">🔬</span>\n      <p class=\"srl-hero__rating-text\">\n        Fabricado en laboratorio certificado &middot; Testado por terceros en cada lote\n      </p>\n    {% endif %}\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"srl-hero__title\">Saben A Manzana, No A Vinagre</h1>\n  <p class=\"srl-hero__subtitle\">El secreto que está arrasando en TikTok</p>\n\n  <div class=\"srl-hero__price-row\">\n    <span class=\"srl-hero__price\">49,98&nbsp;€</span>\n    <span class=\"srl-hero__compare\">74,97&nbsp;€</span>\n    <span class=\"srl-hero__save\">-33%</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"srl-hero__desc\">\n    Las gominolas de vinagre de manzana pensadas para reparar tu intestino desde la raíz —\n    el origen real de esa tripa hinchada, los antojos que no controlas, y el agotamiento\n    de cada tarde.\n  </p>\n\n  <p class=\"srl-hero__list-title\">Con solo 2 al día, ayudas a tu cuerpo a:</p>\n\n  <ul class=\"srl-hero__list\">\n    <li class=\"srl-hero__item\">\n      <span class=\"srl-hero__check\">✓</span>\n      <span class=\"srl-hero__item-text\">\n        <b>Mejorar tu salud digestiva</b> - Menos hinchazón, más energía, digestión sin molestias\n      </span>\n    </li>\n\n    <li class=\"srl-hero__item\">\n      <span class=\"srl-hero__check\">✓</span>\n      <span class=\"srl-hero__item-text\">\n        <b>Reducir la hinchazón</b> - Vientre plano sin parecer embarazada\n      </span>\n    </li>\n\n    <li class=\"srl-hero__item\">\n      <span class=\"srl-hero__check\">✓</span>\n      <span class=\"srl-hero__item-text\">\n        <b>Controlar los antojos</b> - Come menos sin pasar hambre\n      </span>\n    </li>\n\n    <li class=\"srl-hero__item\">\n      <span class=\"srl-hero__check\">✓</span>\n      <span class=\"srl-hero__item-text\">\n        <b>Tener más energía</b> - Nada de quedarte dormida a las 4 de la tarde\n      </span>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</div>"
